(7460260, 1182920, 30861, '<td valign="top">Heck of a story. You look so STERN!</td>', 'Heck of a story. You look so STERN!', '2016-06-15 01:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460338, 1182654, 138253, '<td valign="top">A relic of a bygone era; Also, nice bear trap ;p</td>', 'A relic of a bygone era; Also, nice bear trap ;p', '2016-06-15 11:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460339, 1182892, 138253, '<td valign="top">how are we to know this is not all someone else''s dream.<br/>what happens when they wake?</td>', 'how are we to know this is not all someone else''s dream.what happens when they wake?', '2016-06-15 11:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7460340, 1182823, 138253, '<td valign="top">10, and my top pick.<br/>this is just the visual companion to the stories that will be told by both parties here for years to come.<br/>"Remember when (I/you) used to ride (my/your) bike through the hose?", thinking back fondly to the sunny days of youth spent being young and having fun.<br/>THIS.....this is why I take pictures.<br/>So many people can look at this image, recall their own youthful adventures, smile and even have a tear come to their eye; many more can look at their children or grandchildren and have the love that exists on the other side of the hose, and the joy of seeing that smile over something so simple and carefree.<br/>This is Life, and it is blissful.</td>', '10, and my top pick.this is just the visual companion to the stories that will be told by both parties here for years to come."Remember when (I/you) used to ride (my/your) bike through the hose?", thinking back fondly to the sunny days of youth spent being young and having fun.THIS.....this is why I take pictures.So many people can look at this image, recall their own youthful adventures, smile and even have a tear come to their eye; many more can look at their children or grandchildren and have the love that exists on the other side of the hose, and the joy of seeing that smile over something so simple and carefree.This is Life, and it is blissful.', '2016-06-15 11:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
