(7461220, 1182920, 114285, '<td valign="top">Amazing story Wendy, you have a lot to be thankful for, everyday we must remind ourselves of this.</td>', 'Amazing story Wendy, you have a lot to be thankful for, everyday we must remind ourselves of this.', '2016-06-22 11:01:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7461235, 1182920, 150277, '<td valign="top">What a story.  A grand homage to the scars that remain for so many of us, scars primarily hidden on the the inside long after the traumatic event and long after the healing of exterior wounds.  Such hidden scars that can, however, be seen in the depths of the eyes if one pays close attention.  You surely showed us those eyes here.<br/> <br/>I am so glad you are recovering.  I''m sorry for the continuing fear.  I hope day after day you continue to grow stronger.</td>', 'What a story.  A grand homage to the scars that remain for so many of us, scars primarily hidden on the the inside long after the traumatic event and long after the healing of exterior wounds.  Such hidden scars that can, however, be seen in the depths of the eyes if one pays close attention.  You surely showed us those eyes here. I am so glad you are recovering.  I''m sorry for the continuing fear.  I hope day after day you continue to grow stronger.', '2016-06-22 12:44:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7461236, 1182777, 61396, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by herfotoman:</b></div><hr/><i> Not one comment... Bad.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>not any more! thanks!<br/> <br/>p.s. can''t complain though,as I wasn''t very active myself the last week lor so.</td>', 'Originally posted by herfotoman: Not one comment... Bad. not any more! thanks! p.s. can''t complain though,as I wasn''t very active myself the last week lor so.', '2016-06-22 12:45:41.000000', NULL, 0),
